 - **Key reframe (corrigendum added in-place as `corrigendum_2026_06_09`):** Stage 0's "signal exists but doesn't convert" was over-credit — the latent is a **partial vote shadow**: vote's own within-task AUROC 0.9235 > probe 0.8689; vote-orthogonal residual AUROC 0.3176 (below chance); hard-negative (votes≥5) AUROC 0.6646 fails the 0.70 gate the junk-inflated macro passed. Mechanism: mean-pooling the latent over a candidate's `votes` augmentation views bakes vote count into the feature (corr(‖z_mean‖, log-votes) ≈ −0.80 raw-norm). Model-native TRM confidence signals (scalar AND full latent) are now EXHAUSTED.
 - **Stage 2 (trained generator-INDEPENDENT ARC transition-EBM) is GO** with design constraints from the round: energy from grid CONTENT only (no generator activations, no augmentation pooling — the structural vote leak); task-GROUPED LOTO at 400-task scale; baseline-to-beat is the no-latent votes+q_mean+vote_share union (pass@2 0.4839), not bare vote. GAP-3 build log updated in `ops/verifier_gaps.md`; memory `project_gap3_verifier_program.md` updated.
 - 2026-06-09: Hardware continuity (consolidated; OWED from .366): SSH-reachability + terminal-state check for each attached board — KV260 (ssh kria, xmutil listapps), GateMate (openFPGALoader -c dirtyJtag --detect), PolarFire (ssh polarfire). Record per-board reachability + the next concrete forward step; no bitstream redesign. Per CLAUDE.md KV260 SSH-Not-SD-Card Discipline: NEVER use the host SD-card block device as a KV260 precondition (SSH-reachability is the ONLY valid KV260 precondition). Use DISTINCT wall-clock timers per board (the exp3866 TAUTOLOGY corrigendum). (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=complete: hardware_continuity_3972_kvreachable_overlay_absent_gmblocked_gatemate_unreachable_pfreachable_ssh_continuity_recorded; results/experiment_3972_hardware_continuity.json
+- 2026-06-09: Capstone .367 (UNGATED — the .365 op:exists + .366 no-artifact lessons): aggregate the ARC accuracy + HONEST-efficiency push — total real levels solved across games (exp3964 r11l, exp3965 lp85, exp3966 third game; baseline 2), did a THIRD game solve (exp3966), the HONEST M3 efficiency CIs + verifier_invoked_in_loop self-audit on REAL games (exp3967 — the load-bearing 'verifier earns its place' datum, replacing the FABRICATED exp3959), how many of the 6 non-spatial games reached a trustworthy world-model (exp3968), the Pinductor hidden-state energy drop (exp3969), the ArcMemo cross-game transfer win (exp3970), and the M4 quota-gate readiness (exp3971). Honest verdict on accuracy + efficiency progress. SKIP any flagged_adversarial artifact (NEVER aggregate exp3959-style fabrications); cite upstream sha256. NO gated_on — aggregate whatever exists. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: capstone_v367_accuracy_progress1_total_real_levels3_verifier_earns_efficiencyfalse_missing0_flagged_skipped0; results/experiment_3973_capstone_v367.json
